SCALE-TODO.md

# The forwarder watch directory is runtime staging: both harnesses need it to
# start empty, and both used to get there by deleting tracked fixtures. The
# canonical scans live in testdata/scans/ instead.
/docker/uf/swinv-data/

# Splunkbase listing assets and copy are admin work, not part of the app.
